        "ISO"  : "We use ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ), see: https://www.iso.org/iso-8601-date-and-time-format.html",
        "crs"  : "We suggest using EPSG codes, either specified as an integer or 'EPSG:XXXX'. Proj string can also be used."
